    translationGroup: "co-streaming-squad-streams-reach-calculations-2026",
    seoTitle: {"en":"Co-Streaming and Squad Streams: How They Change Reach Calculations for Brands","no":"Co-streaming og squad-streams: Slik endrer de rekkeviddeberegninger for merkevarer","sv":"Co-streaming och squad-streams: Hur de ändrar räckviddberäkningar för varumärken","fi":"Co-streaming ja squad-streamit: Kuinka ne muuttavat tavoittavuuslaskelmia brändeille"},
    seoDescription: {"en":"Co-streaming drove 1.3B esports watch hours in 2025 and boosts tournament viewership by 28%. How Stream Together changes reach calculations for brand campaigns.","no":"Co-streaming drev 1,3 milliarder esports-seertimer i 2025 og øker turneringsseertall med 28%. Lær hvordan Stream Together endrer rekkeviddeberegninger for merkevarekampanjer på Twitch.","sv":"Co-streaming drev 1,3 miljarder esports-tittartimmar 2025 och ökar turnerings­tittarantal med 28%. Lär dig hur Stream Together ändrar räckviddberäkningar för varumärkeskampanjer.","fi":"Co-streaming tuotti 1,3 miljardia esports-katselutuntia vuonna 2025 ja lisää turnauskatselua 28%. Opi, miten Stream Together muuttaa tavoittavuuslaskelmia brändeille."},
    seoKeywords: {"en":["co-streaming Twitch 2026","Stream Together advertising","squad stream reach","Twitch tournament campaigns","esports co-streaming brands","streaming reach calculation"],"no":["co-streaming Twitch 2026","Stream Together annonsering","squad stream rekkevidde","Twitch turnering kampanjer"],"sv":["co-streaming Twitch 2026","Stream Together annonsering","squad stream räckvidd","Twitch turnering kampanjer"],"fi":["co-streaming Twitch 2026","Stream Together mainonta","squad stream tavoittavuus","Twitch turnaus kampanjat"]},
